    # SITEMP-only doctrinal layers per ATP 2-01.3 Fig 6-3:
    #   - range_fans: enemy weapon envelopes (ADA, artillery, MLRS)
    #     rendered as concentric red rings around the firing position.
    #   - threat time-phase lines (H+N forecast PLs): NO LONGER pre-
    #     authored here. Per-COA derivation at render time from the
    #     writer's axis_role_assignments + catalog avenue polylines +
    #     doctrinal mechanized rate (see handlers/intel_agent.py:
    #     _derive_threat_time_phase_lines). One phase line per H+N
